- description: "This skill performs comprehensive code reviews across 6 dimensions: Security, Performance, Code Quality, Error Handling, Testing, and Documentation. It should be used when reviewing code changes, pull requests, or entire codebases in any programming language. Triggers include requests like 'review this code', 'check for security issues', 'audit this PR', 'find bugs in this code', or when a user asks for code quality analysis. The skill includes automated analysis scripts, security rule databases, language-specific best practices, and generates visual HTML reports."
